      "frameId": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "index": null,
      "text": "blastRadius(repo-a, npm:seed) -> [repo-b (1 hop), repo-c (2 hops)]\nedges resolve by exact package name against whatever is ALREADY indexed;\neach reindex clears that repo's own outgoing edges first, so a removed\ndependency's edge is retracted, never left stale. freshness is always\n\"unknown\" \u2014 packages have no timestamp column.",
      "originalText": "blastRadius(repo-a, npm:seed) -> [repo-b (1 hop), repo-c (2 hops)]\nedges resolve by exact package name against whatever is ALREADY indexed;\neach reindex clears that repo's own outgoing edges first, so a removed\ndependency's edge is retracted, never left stale. freshness is always\n\"unknown\" \u2014 packages have no timestamp column.",
